WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
Speaker 1: In the midst of everything happening&nbsp;
with the Supreme Court. We learned last week&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:08.160
through this leaked decision that in all&nbsp;
likelihood, unless something changes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:13.840
the current Supreme Court is going to be voting&nbsp;
to overturn Roe v Wade as soon as the end of June.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.880
In the midst of all of this protests at the&nbsp;
houses of Supreme Court justices, etc., etc.,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:25.120
and of course, the search for the leaker, which I&nbsp;
really wonder how that's going. Public confidence&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:32.080
in the Supreme Court has absolutely collapsed from&nbsp;
where it was. There is a new poll. Confidence in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:38.960
Supreme Court collapsed since conservatives took&nbsp;
control. This is a new Yahoo! News YouGov poll&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:45.920
